Accessibility acceptance criteria (assets/criterion/*.json, ledgers #3541 and #3542)
------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The wording of the html face's accessibility acceptance criteria for the node kinds is seeded
from the two works below and adapted: mapped to ikigai-ui's node kinds and its html face,
rewritten in American spelling, and cut to the checks that apply. No page is copied whole. Each
criterion names the pages it was seeded from (its `source`). The gpui face's criteria (ledger
#3546) are ikigai-ui's own: neither work covers desktop-native apps, so they draw on each
platform's published accessibility guidance (Apple, Microsoft, GNOME, AT-SPI, AccessKit), which
their `source` names, and copy from none of it. Neither work covers a meter, nor a 3D scene whose replacement is its accessible form: the html
criteria of those two (ledger #3542) are written from this repository's own ACCESSIBILITY.md,
which they name.

